OL,3,GNEWSAWoman faces assisted suicide      
OL,4,Acharge over mum's death                
OL,6,FA woman has been charged with assisting
OL,7,Fthe suicide of her 70-year-old mother  
OL,8,Fwho died from a drug overdose.         
OL,10,FEmma Nightingale, 37, has been charged 
OL,11,Fwith "providing tablets" that ended the
OL,12,Flife of Lorna Nightingale, in December 
OL,13,F2025.                                  
OL,15,FIn an interview with the media in      
OL,16,FAugust, Emma, of Lowestoft, Suffolk,   
OL,17,Fsaid her mother had chronic kidney     
OL,18,Fdisease, severe dental problems, and   
OL,19,Fcataracts affecting both eyes.         
