OL,3,GNEWSAWoman faces assisted suicide      
OL,4,Acharge over mum's death                
OL,6,FIt was said that between 7 and 11      
OL,7,FDecember last year, she "intentionally 
OL,8,Fdid an act, namely provided tablets,   
OL,9,Fwhich was capable of encouraging or    
OL,10,Fassisting the suicide of Lorna         
OL,11,FNightingale".                          
